FORM CORR_MAINT_ZV_SD_COND USING VALUE(CM_ACTION) RC.
  DATA: RETCODE LIKE SY-SUBRC, COUNT TYPE I, TRSP_KEYLEN TYPE SYFLENG.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <TAB_KEY_X> TYPE X.
  CLEAR RC.
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-MATNR TO
ZTCMA00060-MATNR .
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-KUNNR TO
ZTCMA00060-KUNNR .
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-VKORG TO
ZTCMA00060-VKORG .
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-VTWEG TO
ZTCMA00060-VTWEG .
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-VFROM TO
ZTCMA00060-VFROM .
MOVE ZV_SD_COND-MANDT TO
ZTCMA00060-MANDT .
  CORR_KEYTAB             =  E071K.
  CORR_KEYTAB-OBJNAME     = 'ZTCMA00060'.
  IF NOT <vim_corr_keyx> IS ASSIGNED.
    ASSIGN CORR_KEYTAB-TABKEY TO <vim_corr_keyx> CASTING.
  ENDIF.
  ASSIGN ZTCMA00060 TO <TAB_KEY_X> CASTING.
  PERFORM VIM_GET_TRSPKEYLEN
    USING 'ZTCMA00060'
    CHANGING TRSP_KEYLEN.
  <VIM_CORR_KEYX>(TRSP_KEYLEN) = <TAB_KEY_X>(TRSP_KEYLEN).
  PERFORM UPDATE_CORR_KEYTAB USING CM_ACTION RETCODE.
  ADD: RETCODE TO RC, 1 TO COUNT.
  IF RC LT COUNT AND CM_ACTION NE PRUEFEN.
    CLEAR RC.
  ENDIF.

ENDFORM.
